/// M06 CORE-014 "crypto commands: roots green, seven assert roots".
/// Source: tests/integration/crypto_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentCryptoCommands (L49-245).
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/crypto/commands.can (read at
/// L28, staged as src/main.can at L46); every count pin below grounds an
/// assert arm in that fixture (hmac_tag 1, check_password 2,
/// check_signature 1, seal_size 1, main 2; total 7).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 7 roots, grounded per function in the commands.can fixture.
/// Live command outputs, build identity and the negative mutations live in
/// core-014-crypto-commands.can; the production process shape lives in
/// core-014-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); command variants
/// (roundtrip, hmac, ask correct/wrong, misuse, tamper) and the two
/// negative source mutations live in the crypto-commands file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_TSC/CAN_BUN gate the optional
/// strict tsc leg (pinned conditional in the run-shape file). Logical gates
/// SUITE/WORK/PROC/N1 and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run
/// now. Descriptor timeout 240000ms mirrors the Go 4-minute ctx (L57).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QN1 unmet).
/// Case crypto/commands-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, hmac-roots, password-roots, signature-roots,
/// seal-roots, main-roots.
/// Facet map (crypto_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L88-91: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals);
/// report-passed pins the report leg (L93: passed true); root-count pins
/// the seven roots (L93: len assertions is 7); fixture-name grounds the
/// pins in the staged fixture (L28: commands.can; L46: src/main.can);
/// hmac-roots pins hmac_tag (fixture L11: rfc4231 => ok tag, 1 root);
/// password-roots pins check_password (fixture L26-27: hit/miss, 2 roots);
/// signature-roots pins check_signature (fixture L38: valid => ok true,
/// 1 root); seal-roots pins seal_size (fixture L58: sample => ok 19,
/// 1 root); main-roots pins main (fixture L77-78: empty/badop => ok,
/// 2 roots).
